OL,3,GNEWSAExtra #500m for NHS in Welsh
OL,4,Abudget as Reform politicians boycott
OL,5,Athe Senedd
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Welsh government has announced its
OL,8,Ffirst draft budget under Plaid Cymru
OL,10,FDetails of the tax and spending plans
OL,11,Fshow an extra #500m for the NHS, but
OL,12,Fother public services could still feel
OL,13,Fthe pinch
OL,15,FThere are no tax rises, with Finance
OL,16,FMinister Elin Jones saying raising the
OL,17,FWelsh version of stamp duty or income
OL,18,Ftax would have been counterproductive
OL,19,Fto helping with the cost of living
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,433,430,260,140,0,100
